& [FailureModeSet] is explicit
  + [F-01] source or correction bytes drift
  + [F-02] prior signature is silently relabeled valid
  + [F-03] replacement signature omits stage evidence
  + [F-04] profile or behavior changes during governance repair
  + [F-05] header or arithmetic reads outside the region
  + [F-06] offset stalls, misaligns, or escapes
  + [F-07] odd, empty, excessive, or malformed UTF-16 name admits
  + [F-08] wrapper grammar overaccepts
  + [F-09] negative size converts
  + [F-10] terminal trailing bytes disappear
  + [F-11] partial record vector escapes
  + [F-12] pointer, unsafe, dependency, or runtime effect appears
  + [F-13] parser success is cited as physical query completeness or stream admission

