  + [complete_vector] means the entire supplied region parsed, not that physical stream enumeration was complete
  + [raw_stream_record] means structurally decoded syntax, not an admitted topology stream
  + [valid_signature] means processed under the governing SJS protocol with externally bound stage evidence

